{"id":"30257659a1c56ffc","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-index-set.md","title":"程序语义不变量的编号集","display":"df-index-set — 程序语义不变量的编号集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-index-set","aliases":["43-df-index-set"],"display":"df-index-set — 程序语义不变量的编号集","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.2 before Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-index-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-index-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-index-set — 程序语义不变量的编号集"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.2 before Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span>为部分可计算函数的固定可接受枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span>比较部分函数图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in I\\land\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_j\\Rightarrow j\\in I).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in I\\land\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_j\\Rightarrow j\\in I).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>编号集对程序的外延行为不变；停机对角集∅′并不是编号集。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.2 before Theorem 5.2.3, print p.11 / PDF p.31。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IndexSet}(I)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall e,j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(e\\in I\\land\\varphi_e\\simeq\\varphi_j\\Rightarrow j\\in I).","display":true}],"bytes":997,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-index-set]] — 程序语义不变量的编号集"},{"id":"59372eb943ddfc66","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IndexSet}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}$ 分别采用 [[43-df-index-set]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$\\chi_I$ 为 $I$ 的特征函数。"}],"outgoing":["4400f4836786a4bd"]}